{"id":"a3c3ac15f343e7f2","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-semiprojective.md","title":"thm-semiprojective","display":"thm-semiprojective","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-semiprojective]]"],"display":"thm-semiprojective","label":"93-thm-semiprojective","aliases":["93-thm-semiprojective"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f1ed77100bfbf2a\" href=\"?note=7f1ed77100bfbf2a\" title=\"93-df-semiprojective\">93-df-semiprojective</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-semiprojective"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-semiprojective"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-semiprojective</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-semiprojective-thm-semiprojective\">thm-semiprojective <code>thm-semiprojective</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirColim}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{DirColim}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Semiproj}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Semiproj}_{93}\\)</span> are the exact predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7f1ed77100bfbf2a\" href=\"?note=7f1ed77100bfbf2a\" title=\"93-df-semiprojective\">93-df-semiprojective</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}semiprojective}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Semiproj}_{93}(A;\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall I\\;\\forall R\\;\\forall\\mathbf B\\;\\forall\\mathbf q\\;\\forall L\\;\\forall\\boldsymbol\\lambda\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{DirColim}_{93}\n(L,\\boldsymbol\\lambda;I,R,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf q;\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\to\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,L)\\;\n\\exists i\\in I\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,\\mathbf B(i))\\;\n\\bigl(\\boldsymbol\\lambda(i)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g=f\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}semiprojective}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Semiproj}_{93}(A;\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall I\\;\\forall R\\;\\forall\\mathbf B\\;\\forall\\mathbf q\\;\\forall L\\;\\forall\\boldsymbol\\lambda\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{DirColim}_{93}\n(L,\\boldsymbol\\lambda;I,R,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf q;\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}\\to\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,L)\\;\n\\exists i\\in I\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,\\mathbf B(i))\\;\n\\bigl(\\boldsymbol\\lambda(i)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g=f\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Semiprojectivity is a finite-stage factorization property for directed colimits of epimorphisms. Every arrow in the displayed equation now has a declared domain and codomain.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-semiprojective-thm-semiprojective","text":"thm-semiprojective `thm-semiprojective`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-semiprojective","status":"resolved","id":"7f1ed77100bfbf2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-semiprojective]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-semiprojective","status":"resolved","id":"7f1ed77100bfbf2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirColim}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Semiproj}_{93}$ are the exact predicates of [[93-df-semiprojective]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirColim}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Semiproj}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}semiprojective}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Semiproj}_{93}(A;\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall I\\;\\forall R\\;\\forall\\mathbf B\\;\\forall\\mathbf q\\;\\forall L\\;\\forall\\boldsymbol\\lambda\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{DirColim}_{93}\n(L,\\boldsymbol\\lambda;I,R,\\mathbf B,\\mathbf q;\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\hspace{3em}\\to\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,L)\\;\n\\exists i\\in I\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,\\mathbf B(i))\\;\n\\bigl(\\boldsymbol\\lambda(i)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g=f\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1235,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["7f1ed77100bfbf2a"]}